 Broadcast server;tick;clients;i;old;data
⍝ Every second, send every connected client a "price" event for each symbol, and every 5 seconds a "news" event
⍝ server - the Jarvis server
⍝ Runs in its own thread, started by Run, until Stop sets Running to 0. Not an endpoint (see IncludeFns in Run).
⍝ Symbols, Prices, Headlines, and Running are variables in this namespace (#.Ex3), set by Run.
⍝ After editing this function, run Restart (not Run) so the loop uses your new code.
 tick←0
 :While Running
     ⎕DL 1
     tick+←1
     :Trap 0 ⍝ nothing else catches an error in this thread: report it and carry on
⍝ Step S3: write your code here. The README step S3 has the pieces you need.
     :Else
         ⎕←'Broadcast: ',⎕DMX.EM,(0<≢⎕DMX.Message)/': ',⎕DMX.Message
     :EndTrap
 :EndWhile
